{"3250020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell Dive", "steam_appid": 3250020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/ba40d81de2682c64c748c33484f452b3.poster.avif?t=1781141165\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/ba40d81de2682c64c748c33484f452b3.webm?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/ba40d81de2682c64c748c33484f452b3.mp4?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far beneath an icy ocean, Maritime Operative Daniel awakens alone aboard his submarine. His mission to revive COLONY 1265, an abandoned deep-sea mining and research facility, takes a deadly turn as reactivated systems unveil fragments of its haunting past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided only by VIRGIL, his AI companion, Daniel must navigate seven interconnected facilities scattered across the ocean floor, each step bringing him closer to a chilling truth hidden in the darkness. But some horrors are better left buried - something watches, something waits. Descend into the unknown. Revive the colony. Unearth the truth. And remember - survival is expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/90b9dd867869340571365a21602d284d.poster.avif?t=1781141165\" width=1170 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/90b9dd867869340571365a21602d284d.webm?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of the Arctic in this first-person horror game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the deep-sea facilities in your submarine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of why the facilities were abandoned in the first place.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, and interact with the environment to complete your mission.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dying from drowning, fire, suffocation, and attacks from monsters and unknown lifeforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/2dffc5f36e9950cec93a4768ae6841cc.poster.avif?t=1781141165\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/2dffc5f36e9950cec93a4768ae6841cc.webm?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/2dffc5f36e9950cec93a4768ae6841cc.mp4?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/ba40d81de2682c64c748c33484f452b3.poster.avif?t=1781141165\" width=1170 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250020/extras/ba40d81de2682c64c748c33484f452b3.webm?t=1781141165\" type=\"video/webm; co